    <description>Created by Michael Nguyen for  Stefanie Schuetze
Solution Details filtered to 
SDN – NSX
SDS-vSan,SDS - vSan,SDS – vSAN
Vmware vRealize
Vmware vCloud
ENFV-Velocloud (VMWare) SD-WAN
ENFV- VMWare NSX Virtual Firewall
VMware</description>
    <filter>
        <booleanFilter>(1 OR 2 OR 3 OR 4 OR 5 OR 6 OR 7) AND 8</booleanFilter>
        <criteriaItems>
